.github
.env
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.template
build
_data
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/*.pyc
**/*.egg-info
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
